{number: 53}
{title: The Church’s One Foundation}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
The [C] Church's one foun-[F] da-[C] tion
Is [F] Jesus [C] Christ her [G] Lord;
She [C] is His new cre-[F] a-[C] tion
By [Dm] water [C] and the [G7] Word:
From [C] heaven He came and [F] sought [C] her
To [F] be His [C] holy [G] bride;
With [C] His own blood He [F] bought [C] her,
And [Dm] for her [G7] life He [C] died.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
E-[C] lect from every [F] na-[C] tion,
Yet [F] one o'er [C] all the [G] earth,
Her [C] charter of sal-[F] va-[C] tion,
